		<comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Another Urfehde proceeding of a person, after an editors&apos; note &quot;kommt in einem anderen Urfehdeverfahren vor&quot;, resolved to the entry on the cited folio whose heading matches the cited one. Stated in the direction of the note, not transitive.</comment>
