		<comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">An entry that an editors&apos; note of this entry names as belonging to it, a statement and its Urfehde or a continuation, resolved by the cited folio and heading. Stated in the direction of the note.</comment>
