		<comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">The categories FrüheresUrfehdeverfahren and AnderesUrfehdeverfahren, a reference in the text itself. The proceeding it names is resolved only where the editors&apos; notes cite it, as ufbas-ont:refersToProceeding.</comment>
		<label xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">reference to another proceeding</label>
		<label xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="de">Verweis auf ein anderes Verfahren</label>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
