		<comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Everything the group Strafe of the taxonomy codes, sanctions, modalities, procedural outcomes and obligations. The kind is its category.</comment>
		<label xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">sanction</label>
		<label xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="de">Strafe</label>
